IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COBLSKY.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
	
	COPY DD-NETWORK.
	
	01 DONE PIC 9 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
	CALL "NETWORK-INIT" USING NETWORK-SHARED.
	
	IF SOCK-FD EQUALS -1 THEN
	    STOP RUN.
	
	PERFORM UNTIL DONE EQUALS 1
	
	    CALL "NETWORK-RECEIVE" USING NETWORK-SHARED, NETWORK-REQUEST
		
		IF REQUEST-LEN EQUALS 0 THEN
		   STOP RUN
		   
	END-PERFORM.
	
	STOP RUN.